  "description": "Han Seok-ho has it all — looks, success, wealth, and a perfect family. As Korea’s most popular announcer and the son-in-law of a broadcasting company chairman, he lives a life most people can only dream of. Behind the polished public image, however, he secretly indulges in numerous affairs.\n\nOne day, a mysterious man named Jo Tae-woong appears and confronts him with evidence of his double life. What begins as blackmail quickly turns into a ruthless psychological battle, as Seok-ho’s carefully built world starts to unravel under the pressure of someone who seems to know everything about him.",
